  "ruleText": "Res 2710.01 Information. The public may obtain information regarding the JTP by contacting the DED as described in Res 103.01.\n\nSource. #8975, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRED: 3-12-08\n\nNew. #9498, eff 7-1-09, EXPIRED: 7-1-17\n\nAPPENDIX",
